WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.120
Twenty years ago, we started with a simple question.

00:05.120 --> 00:08.520
Could our creativity make global communication easier?

00:08.520 --> 00:13.880
The industry kept changing, and so did the languages, formats, technologies, and challenges

00:13.880 --> 00:17.680
our clients brought us. And we kept finding new ways forward.

00:17.680 --> 00:23.040
Along the way, we built our greatest strength: a team that listens, finds solutions,

00:23.040 --> 00:25.480
and treats every project as its own.

00:25.480 --> 00:31.280
Today, our identity evolves to reflect who we've become: a trusted partner, a creative

00:31.280 --> 00:37.520
problem solver. Any language. Every format. All tools. One team.

00:37.520 --> 00:42.480
Twenty years of evolution. Different in appearance, the same in essence.

00:42.480 --> 00:48.000
The Typesetter. Making global communication easy.
